{"product_id":"spot-the-difference-around-the-world","title":"Spot the Difference Around the World","description":"\u003cp\u003eEagle-eyed youngsters will find hours of fun, fascination and quirky humour in this book filled with spot-the-difference activities, which showcases artworks by talented children's illustrator Genie Espinosa. From a llama farm in Peru to Slovakian fairytale castles by way of the Great Barrier Reef and kite-flying in Pakistan, no two \"identical\" pictures are ever quite the same. Perfect for puzzlers aged 5 and up.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 230 x 260\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Genie Espinosa\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781788884983\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45721480233113,"sku":"15RC-3-9781788884983","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68c7abad5a21b_Spot_the_Difference_Around_the_World_Genie_Espinosa.jpg?v=1757931881","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/spot-the-difference-around-the-world","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}